Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:07.90,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But... Adagaki Aki didn't remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.84,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:14.76,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Why do you call me Pig's Foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.82,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Of course, I don't have any proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:20.84,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,The Cruel Princess could just be playing dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.80,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But I want to hear it \Nfrom you personally, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.75,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:32.32,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Right. I mean, all this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:43.86,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,We were in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:51.56,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're such an idiot, Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:54.90,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'd never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:56.74,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,O-Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:00:59.95,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:00.99,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:06.34,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:43.05,Episode Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1475,525)}#4 "{\c&H318DF1&}I{\c}'{\c&H318DF1&}m {\c}N{\c&H318DF1&}o{\c}t {\c&H318DF1&}G{\c}o{\c&H318DF1&}i{\c}n{\c&H318DF1&}g {\c}t{\c&H318DF1&}o {\c}F{\c&H318DF1&}a{\c}l{\c&H318DF1&}l {\c}i{\c&H318DF1&}n {\c}L{\c&H318DF1&}o{\c}v{\c&H318DF1&}e {\c}w{\c&H318DF1&}i{\c}t{\c&H318DF1&}h {\c}Y{\c&H318DF1&}o{\c}u{\c&H318DF1&}, {\c}P{\c&H318DF1&}i{\c}g{\c&H318DF1&}'{\c}s {\c&H318DF1&}F{\c}o{\c&H318DF1&}o{\c}t"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.35,0:02:49.37,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan, where should we go? \NIs there anywhere you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:53.15,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You can't expect me to decide so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:57.24,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,O-Of course. Just take \Nyour time and think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:01.82,Flashback,Sonoka; Kikune; Mari,0,0,0,,Let you spend time with Aki-sama alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:05.70,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Yes. I have something very \Nimportant to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:11.07,Flashback,Kikune,0,0,0,,You'd better not be trying to do \Nsomething sleazy to Aki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:13.40,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:18.84,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I mean, I just said I'd wait until \Nshe sorted out her feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:23.34,Flashback,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Then why did you say out of the blue\Nthat you wanted to be alone with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:26.72,Flashback,Mari,0,0,0,,Aki-sama clearly seems depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:31.98,Flashback,Mari,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not using this \Nas an excuse to get closer to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:34.73,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,It's the opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:39.91,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,It's because Aki-chan's in that state that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:44.49,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'm going to try to separate her \Nfrom Makabe Masamune for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:46.55,Flashback,Mari,0,0,0,,B-But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:52.83,Flashback,Sonoka,0,0,0,,I know! We have that picture of \NKoiwai Yoshino and Makabe Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:54.89,Flashback,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Let's start spreading rumors of things
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:58.51,Flashback,Sonoka,0,0,0,,that may or may not have \Nhappened and ruin his image!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:04.72,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I considered that, too, \Nbut that's the last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:06.51,Flashback,Kikune,0,0,0,,Why, though?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:09.39,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Even if she found out about \NMakabe and Koiwai Yoshino,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:13.69,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan's relationship with Koiwai Yoshino \Nwouldn't be the worst it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:19.15,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,But if we try to make it worse, \NAki-chan's the one who'll be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:25.47,Flashback,Mari,0,0,0,,True. If Aki-sama and Koiwai Yoshino's \Nrelationship were to completely fall apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:28.96,Flashback,Mari,0,0,0,,it'd prove difficult to get Aki-sama \Nback on her feet, even for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:31.16,Flashback,Kikune,0,0,0,,Though I hate to admit that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:34.24,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan isn't the one we're \Nsupposed to be attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:35.42,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Makabe is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:40.89,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,Not to mention, even if we deliberately \Ntry to separate Makabe from Aki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:45.43,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,our hard work will be wasted \Nif Koiwai Yoshino gets in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:51.98,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,That's why our first priority is to make sure \NKoiwai Yoshino doesn't get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:55.45,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,And then, we'll get Aki-chan to \Nstop hanging out with Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.81,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to make sure that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:04.14,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,But knowing Koiwai Yoshino, \Nshe'll catch on if we take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:09.00,Flashback,Gasou,0,0,0,,I need you three to act first and make \Nsure she doesn't get near Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:17.00,Flashback,Sonoka,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:21.38,Flashback,Mari,0,0,0,,I do feel bad for Aki-sama, \Nbut this is for her own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.88,Flashback,Kikune,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.16,Flashback,Kikune,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Koiwai Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:26.63,Flashback,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Yup, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:28.35,Flashback,Mari,0,0,0,,Let's think up a sabotage plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:29.42,Flashback,Kikune,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:30.97,Flashback,Sonoka and Mari,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:37.56,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Still, there's no guarantee with this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:39.44,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,We have to go to a place where we know for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.94,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,that neither Koiwai Yoshino \Nnor Makabe will show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:51.41,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Aki-chan, would you like to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:52.50,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.07,0:05:55.12,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:58.12,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Well, no time like the present!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:05:59.93,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.51,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\fs9\an4\c&HAAB9BC&\3c&HE9F8F5&\pos(287.999,318.667)\frx0\fry318\frz64.3}Aki-sama\NI'm going to head to the Ferris wheel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.97,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:20.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:22.56,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The reason's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:26.49,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Because... It's because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:29.36,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,hated you so much, I could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:38.28,Flashback,Yoshino's mother,0,0,0,,You've got chickenpox.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:42.46,Flashback,Yoshino's mother,0,0,0,,It's highly contagious, so make sure \Nyou stay away from Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:45.34,Flashback,Yoshino's mother,0,0,0,,You can't leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.55,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.72,Flashback,Yoshino's Mother,0,0,0,,Until you're completely better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:54.39,Flashback,Yoshino's Mother,0,0,0,,Make sure you tell Aki-sama \Nto stay out of this room, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:55.34,Flashback,Attendant,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:03.94,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,It's fine if I can't see Aki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:06.10,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:13.21,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Back then, I was at constantly at the mercy \Nof Aki-sama's endless bad moods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:24.52,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Mom, I can't go outside today, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.27,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,I don't have a fever anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.27,0:07:27.69,Flashback,Yoshino's Mother,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:29.69,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,How many more days?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:32.52,Flashback,Yoshino's Mother,0,0,0,,We'll just have to wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:38.74,Flashback,Yoshino (Young),0,0,0,,It's so quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:42.41,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (Young),0,0,0,,I don't even have anything to add to my diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.15,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(418.667,120.667)\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&H78C8CD&\c&HD1DDE6&\fs14\frz32.66\frx348\fry14}Kids' Study Notebook
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.15,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&HDADEDD&\c&H8382BD&\fs14\frx348\fry14\frz10.5\pos(272,169.333)}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.15,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&HC5C4C2&\c&HA4BABD&\fs12\frx348\fry14\frz36.85\pos(460.667,260.666)}Kids' {\c&H7A80A4&}Study Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:48.11,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs10\c&H979A76&\3c&HD9DCD9&}Weather: {\c&H68696B&}Sunny\NHandkerchief\NAki-sama made fun of the\Nhandkerchief Mom made for me.\NShe said it looked poor\Nand that made it weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:48.11,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(825,0)\an7\fs10\c&H979A76&\3c&HD9DCD9&}Weather: {\c&H68696B&}Sunny\N Fireworks\NAki-sama suddenly said she\Nwanted to try an experiment\Nwith skyrocket fireworks to see\Nif she could send someone\Nto the moon with them.\NI was scared.\NFireworks are scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:47.14,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,I've only written stuff about Aki-sama, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:53.07,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\an7\fs13\3c&HD9DCD9&\c&H68696B&}I ended up crying because Aki-sama\Ncut the hair off my favorite doll.\NBut my mom told me to just deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:56.99,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Aki-sama might be bored, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:59.54,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,because she has no one to make her plaything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:03.50,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Is she mad? Is she sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:06.00,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Maybe she's even crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:08.28,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:12.22,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Aki-sama's someone I have to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.33,0:08:15.91,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Even if I'm not around...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:19.18,Flashback,Aki (Young),0,0,0,,Come on! Try harder, Masamune!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:20.76,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Aki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:27.39,Flashback,Aki (young),0,0,0,,If you stop, Sean will catch up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:29.48,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,I can't do this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:32.44,Flashback,Aki (Young),0,0,0,,Then give up and get along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:35.41,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,A boy I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.77,0:08:39.96,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,I guess she can find a plaything to \Norder around whenever she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:42.60,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,But he's doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.84,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (Young),0,0,0,,He's just going to get yelled \Nat and bullied by Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:47.02,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:48.12,Flashback,Aki (young),0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:52.06,Flashback,Aki (young),0,0,0,,Looks like we caught you, Masamune!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:55.55,Flashback,Masamune (young),0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.25,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I think I was in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:09.47,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I thought I was the only one \Nwho could keep up with Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:12.90,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And yet... he seemed so much happier than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.70,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I could tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:18.09,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,that he...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:20.98,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,really liked Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:30.09,Flashback,Yoshino's Mother,0,0,0,,Did she get Yoshino's \Nchickenpox after this long?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:33.80,Flashback,Attendant,0,0,0,,Well, she has been playing \Noutside quite often lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.55,Flashback,Attendant,0,0,0,,Maybe she caught some unknown bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:41.46,Flashback,Yoshino's Mother,0,0,0,,Yoshino, keep an eye on Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:47.76,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,Are you okay, Aki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:50.39,Flashback,Aki (Young),0,0,0,,Is this your fault, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:52.98,Flashback,Yoshino (young),0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:57.36,Flashback,Aki (young),0,0,0,,This is awful. I hate being in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:10:01.18,Flashback,Aki (young),0,0,0,,Too many of Mom and Dad's things are in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:04.70,Flashback,Aki's Father,0,0,0,,You can't even take care of your own daughter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.39,Flashback,Aki's Mother,0,0,0,,I can say the same exact thing about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:10.51,Flashback,Yoshino's Mother,0,0,0,,Sir, Madam, Aki-sama is trying to rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.51,0:10:11.92,Flashback,Aki's Father,0,0,0,,You're the one who was by her side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.62,Flashback,Aki's Mother,0,0,0,,Would you shut up already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:21.05,Flashback,Aki (young),0,0,0,,They said "divorce" means that my mom \Nand dad won't be married anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.45,0:10:25.26,Flashback,Aki (young),0,0,0,,Mom's going to leave me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:27.95,Flashback,Aki (young),0,0,0,,She says she can't help it \Nbecause of a trial or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:31.36,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (Young),0,0,0,,Is Aki-sama... crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:37.82,Flashback,Aki (Young),0,0,0,,But I'm not alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:40.20,Flashback,Aki (Young),0,0,0,,Because I have Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:41.61,Flashback,Aki (Young),0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:49.66,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (Young),0,0,0,,Hey, Aki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:51.46,Flashback Italics,Yoshino (Young),0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:56.42,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'd worked so hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:11:01.89,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'd done everything she told me \Nto do ever since I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:06.81,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Because... that's what I was told to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.08,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.35,0:11:14.98,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:16.58,Flashback Top,Yoshino (Young),0,0,0,,That voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:22.36,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan! Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:25.02,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:30.20,Flashback,Boy A,0,0,0,,This loser's trying to get that \Nboss girl to save him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:31.83,Flashback,Boy B,0,0,0,,Talk about pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.47,0:12:11.83,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:14.04,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:16.13,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:18.86,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:22.35,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan! Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:25.67,Flashback,Masamune (Young),0,0,0,,Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:33.48,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,After that, you stopped coming around, \Nand it was a huge weight off my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.01,0:12:38.19,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's white as a sheet. I guess I can't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:45.11,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Everything he thought he knew is \Nbeing destroyed down to its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:51.66,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But it wasn't good for Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.71,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,She fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:59.21,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,She cried every day and ended up hating boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:04.67,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I regretted my actions \Nfor the first time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:09.14,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I realized that I did something \NI never should have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:13.88,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I looked for that boy for a really long time, \Nbut I could never find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:19.19,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,When I thought there was nothing \NI could do to make up for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:20.76,Flashback,Female students,0,0,0,,Wait, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:23.86,Flashback Top,Female student A,0,0,0,,Hey, look! He's apparently a transfer student!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.59,Flashback,Female students,0,0,0,,Go talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:26.92,Flashback,Female student B,0,0,0,,Makabe Masamune-kun is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:29.83,Flashback Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Masamune...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:32.79,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,There you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:39.43,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I knew right away that it was you, Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:43.52,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You recognized me right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:46.05,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Even though Adagaki Aki couldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:50.01,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama's a bit dense. \NPlease forgive her for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:54.30,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That's just how powerful \Nyour old image is in her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:54.98,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:59.82,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I ended up helping you out \Nbecause you remembered Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:03.69,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I figured it could be the way \Nto make it up to Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.69,0:14:06.80,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute! \NHow is that making it up to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:09.20,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get revenge here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:12.27,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I was going to make her fall for \Nme just so I could dump her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:16.37,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Even you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:19.61,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If you dump her, and that makes \Nher a little more modest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:22.22,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,it greatly benefits me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:23.34,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,as well as Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.09,0:14:28.17,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:31.68,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I didn't actually want you to dump her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:33.68,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:37.85,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,you can't hate Aki-sama when you've seen her
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:40.15,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,for who she truly is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:54.95,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Right now, Aki-sama is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:59.00,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,on a date with Kanetsugu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:02.50,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,She still thinks he's Pig's Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:07.46,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I can't make any moves
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.46,0:15:11.72,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,because my parents and some other \Npeople are keeping their eye on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:15.46,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,So, Pig's Foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.30,0:15:19.08,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I need you to save Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:28.09,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.34,0:15:38.23,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yes, go, Pig's Foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.74,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,To Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:52.38,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:55.05,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Master is also an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:16:01.73,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Everyone is a big, huge idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:09.42,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Okay, we got this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:12.96,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Now, how do I take the first step?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:14.17,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:19.93,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Huh? Er, I was just thinking how I finally \Ngot to be alone with you, Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:22.34,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.52,0:16:27.46,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Ugh, what is Yoshino doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:30.80,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,Sorry, Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:37.96,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,But I need to get guaranteed additional \Nfunds from your family, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:43.12,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,But considering I was already getting funding,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.48,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,I knew it would've proved \Ndifficult if I asked for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:50.90,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,That's why I need you to \Npersonally ask your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.97,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,That would mean
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:57.00,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,you'd have to accept the Adagaki and Gasou \Nfamilies being connected by marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:16:59.91,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,But I'm very aware...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:05.37,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,that the shadow of a certain man \Ncontinues to live in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:09.19,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,And I need to make that shadow \Ndisappear here and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.45,0:17:13.09,Italics,Gasou,0,0,0,,in order to protect my own happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:21.14,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,Makabe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:23.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You three...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.59,0:17:26.92,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck is he doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:32.00,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,I-I have no idea! \NBut we have to stop him, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:37.61,Main,Kikune,0,0,0,,But what if Koiwai Yoshino gets \Nto Aki-sama in the meantime?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:38.82,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Perfect timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:42.70,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Do you know where \NKanetsugu and Adagaki Aki are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:46.04,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Like we'd ever tell you, you cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:48.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Cheater?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:53.46,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,We are aware that you have been having \Nsecret rendezvous with Koiwai Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:59.14,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,So what exactly are you planning \Nto tell Aki-sama right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:05.96,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,See? You're speechless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:08.03,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Now stay away from Aki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:08.90,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.61,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Wh-What did you just say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:15.45,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I have no intention of clearing up \Nthese little misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:19.07,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,If you're going to call me trash, \Nthat's fine, because it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:22.92,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.15,0:18:28.54,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Who's going to save Adagaki Aki \Nfrom Gasou Kanetsugu's lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:31.42,Main,Sonoka,0,0,0,,Gasou Kanetsugu's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.85,0:18:32.94,Main,Mari,0,0,0,,...lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:38.54,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,If you really care about Aki-sama, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:41.67,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Where are those two right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.33,0:18:50.08,Flashback,Mari,0,0,0,,So what exactly are you planning \Nto tell Aki-sama right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:55.44,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,What am I planning to tell Adagaki Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:18:59.52,Main,Mob,0,0,0,,This is good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:01.87,Black Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H5D7B8B&\3c&HEBF9FE&\fnTrebuchet MS\fs18\fay-.2\frx2\fry348\move(405,114,380,114)}Fresh Ice Cream
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:00.52,Main,Mob,0,0,0,,Want to take a little break?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:00.94,Main,Mob,0,0,0,,Really? Let me try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:02.83,Main,Mob,0,0,0,,I want to go on the roller coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.06,Main,Mob,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:10.60,Main,Mob,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'm tall enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:16.70,Main,Little girl's big brother,0,0,0,,You dropped it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:18.46,Main,Little girl's big brother,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.28,Main,Little girl's big brother,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:26.64,Main,Little girl,0,0,0,,Thanks, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:28.59,Main,Little girl's big brother,0,0,0,,Don't drop it again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.59,0:19:29.58,Main,Little girl,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:32.48,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Here you go, Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:35.44,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.00,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,You finally smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:44.16,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Did I seem that unfriendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:46.87,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn't say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:50.54,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,But you've been trying to \Nact tough for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:53.25,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,If this is helping you relax, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:58.65,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You're really good at calming people \Ndown, or making them a bit kinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:20:01.76,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Really? Maybe it's because \NI have a little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:06.47,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Your little sister's still in the hospital, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:07.82,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.85,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:16.03,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,I'd feel bad for asking. I'm already \Ncausing you enough trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:18.36,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't be able to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.67,0:20:25.32,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,That's not true, Kane— \NMasamune. You came back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.28,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Of course I'd help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:38.21,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,So, really... Ask me for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:46.84,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Um, Aki-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:50.39,Main,Gasou,0,0,0,,Actually—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.24,0:20:54.31,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Makabe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.52,0:21:00.40,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Quit using my damn name!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:15.80,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Please... reach Aki-sama in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:20.67,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Please let these feelings \Nthat started with hatred
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:24.14,Italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,be something I can let go of here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:31.50,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Wait, Makabe! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:33.43,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Then there's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:36.14,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Even if this is all just a \Ngiant misunderstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:40.31,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I can't let your current ugly \Npersonality off the hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:42.07,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,Ug—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:44.03,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So really...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:46.99,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,If you're gonna go out with someone like him...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.27,0:21:52.87,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Go out with the real...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:54.94,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Go out with me instead!
